SoweRead originated as a fork of MiuRead (觅阅), which itself originated
as a modified version of WeRead KOReader Plugin v0.1.1. Development of
this modified work began in 2026, and the project has since undergone
substantial restructuring, modification, and extension, including the
removal of MiuRead's annotation/highlight sync, thoughts/comments,
WeChat official-account (MP) article reading, and full-text search
features, and a redesigned lazy chapter-loading and network-scheduling
architecture.

